      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is true. The persistence of menus is way too aggresive and I constantly find myself clicking the back arrow on every single tab which is annoying. It throws off my muscle memory when sometimes I have to go back a view and sometimes I don't",
      "viewerReactions": null,
