  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-09T20:55:57.532Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I find it very annoying to join on a friend and then when I want to leave I open the menu and I am still looking at my friend. It works the same for worlds, and every other thing.\n I already joined my friend or the world I was clicked on - why would I want to be looking at that page still when opening the menu?\nI would rather be sent back to the default page of the 'social' tab or back to my friend list than be stuck on my friend.\nWhen I close my menu I want it to be reset to the 'default' when I open it again, which is how the quick menu currently works.",
